{
  "name": "storybook-pop",
  "vibe": "An open book that never stops turning. On cream page #f8efdf, two facing leaves are drawn with a hand-inked outline, a red ribbon #cf4633 hangs from the spine, four rule lines run across the verso, and one page sweeps back and forth forever while ten gold #d9a13b sparkles drift upward and twinkle. Bitter's slab serif reads like a printed chapter head over Nunito Sans; statement beats go forest green #3e6b4c and the CTA goes full ribbon red. It owns Scroll:stack, which deals cards one at a time and lifts the top one away with an n/N counter, and DragDrop:drag, which arcs a chip into a dashed slot and locks it with a tick. The calmest camera in the set. Best for kids' publishing, family apps, courses and nonprofits.",
